OMNeT++ Experiment 26
Title: Capturing Simulation Traffic in Wireshark

Description:
Creates a simulated packet flow and records packet counts, protocol distribution, and traffic volume for Wireshark-style analysis.

Project source files:
- Experiment_26.ned  (NED network and simple module)
- Experiment_26.cc   (C++ simulation module)
- omnetpp.ini           (simulation configuration)

Run in an installed OMNeT++ project:
  opp_makemake
  make
  ./Experiment26Network -u Cmdenv -f omnetpp.ini

NOTE: Graph and console images in this folder are prepared demonstration artifacts.
Run this project in OMNeT++ to obtain environment-specific simulation logs and vectors.
